# Trash finders

## Required behavior

- Default finds omit trashed rows; use Trash finders/options the project already uses to include only-trashed or with-trashed.
- Restores go through `restoreTrash` / cascading restore — not ad-hoc nulling of the field in controllers.
- Controllers/commands stay thin; Tables own trash/restore APIs.

## Anti-patterns

- Nulling `deleted` in a controller as “restore”
- Listing trashed rows in normal index without an explicit admin finder
